The rule as written says for conformance.kernel.recovered-from-prose: "Whether the harness had to recover the object from prose or a fence (yes) or read it as strict JSON (no)." The input is strict JSON, so the check's answer ought to be no. The rewritten text wraps the same object in a code fence, so the harness had to recover it from a fence, and the check's answer ought to be yes. Therefore the answer moves.